Health Checks
Liveness Probe

Liveness probe checks if the container is alive. 
If it’s stuck or crashed, Kubernetes restarts it. Checks start after initialDelaySeconds and repeat every periodSeconds.”

initialDelaySeconds → Time to wait after container starts before the first check.

periodSeconds → How often to perform the check.
_______________________________________________________________________
Readiness Probe

“Readiness probe tells if a pod can handle requests. If it’s not ready, Kubernetes stops sending traffic until it’s healthy.”
Checks start after an initial delay and repeat periodically; if it’s not ready, traffic won’t go to the pod.”
